    "title": "TitanSystem supplier collections and returns",
    "version": "2026.10.22.1",
    "description": "Local manual external evidence, never authenticated supplier approval. All request properties required; unused fields empty/zero. Exact unit thousandths. Physical stock atomic with private immutable return history and existing stock.operation outbox. No automatic fiscal or financial effects. Dispatch exactly authorized quantity; partial supplier receipt and recovery supported."
